Subject: [PATCH v4 2/2] mtd: rawnand: renesas: Use runtime PM instead of the
 raw clock API
Date: Fri, 13 May 2022 12:49:57 +0200
Message-Id: <20220513104957.257721-3-miquel.raynal@bootlin.com>
